flickos-menu (1.32~test8) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Prompt style: the search bar's results (phases 12-14, ADR-017 to
    ADR-020). A sum such as 15*3 shows its answer, which Enter copies;
    desktop tasks (Restart Panel, Reload Desktop, screenshots, tiling,
    Show Desktop; Log Out, Restart and Shut Down on a second Enter) come
    below the apps; = asks for a sum (15% of 240), / for files and
    folders by name (fdfind in the home folder, after a pause, killed by
    the next key), > for a command the user's shell runs in a new
    terminal that waits for Enter. The rows come from JSON providers in
    /usr/share/flickos/menu/providers, read by providers.py, which only
    this style loads. A search that finds nothing also offers files of
    that name and the terminal. Depends: fd-find, wl-clipboard.

